WEBVTT

00:00:14.570 --> 00:00:16.160
Polar Bear's Café

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:20.450
Polar Bear's Café

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:34.900
Polar 
 Bear's 
  Café

00:01:31.790 --> 00:01:33.740
Everyone's Café!

00:01:39.770 --> 00:01:42.390
The mornings at my house start early.

00:01:50.870 --> 00:01:52.800
As soon as everyone wakes up,

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:57.240
we all gather in the 
yard to practice Tai Chi.

00:01:59.200 --> 00:02:03.220
The reason being, my grandfather is 
a master of Chinese martial arts.

00:02:06.360 --> 00:02:10.040
As soon as we're done with 
Tai Chi, we eat breakfast.

00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:13.190
Luck

00:02:18.290 --> 00:02:20.350
How long are you planning on sleeping?

00:02:21.550 --> 00:02:24.740
The zoo's closed today,

00:02:24.740 --> 00:02:26.660
so let me sleep.

00:02:27.230 --> 00:02:30.340
Everyone else has already gotten up, 
finished their Tai Chi,

00:02:30.340 --> 00:02:32.020
and are eating breakfast.

00:02:32.480 --> 00:02:34.880
Tai Chi, right?

00:02:34.880 --> 00:02:37.130
I can do that in bed.

00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:39.210
Good grief.

00:02:41.240 --> 00:02:44.220
Don't suck me up!

00:02:54.960 --> 00:02:56.410
Are you tired?

00:02:57.040 --> 00:02:59.350
I haven't been exercising 
enough lately,

00:02:59.350 --> 00:03:00.620
so my shoulders are stiff.

00:03:01.170 --> 00:03:04.340
Could you rub my 
shoulders, Miss Sasako?

00:03:05.680 --> 00:03:07.040
Well...

00:03:08.060 --> 00:03:09.080
What's wrong?

00:03:09.840 --> 00:03:12.350
I can't seem to find your shoulders.

00:03:13.880 --> 00:03:16.960
Where exactly are your 
shoulders, Mr. Penguin?

00:03:16.960 --> 00:03:19.920
Huh? They're right here. 
Can't you tell?

00:03:22.020 --> 00:03:23.390
I'm afraid not.

00:03:23.810 --> 00:03:26.910
Then could you rub my 
shoulders, Polar Bear?

00:03:26.910 --> 00:03:27.720
Sure.

00:03:31.780 --> 00:03:33.780
You're stabbing me! Stabbing!

00:03:36.860 --> 00:03:38.030
Hello.

00:03:38.630 --> 00:03:39.840
Hello.

00:03:39.840 --> 00:03:41.540
Hey there, Panda.

00:03:42.250 --> 00:03:44.530
Oh, you're here, Mr. Penguin?

00:03:45.370 --> 00:03:48.160
You have the day off from the zoo today?

00:03:48.850 --> 00:03:50.060
Yep.

00:03:50.060 --> 00:03:52.350
Could I get the usual, Miss Sasako?

00:03:52.350 --> 00:03:54.390
A large serving of bamboo, 
coming right up.

00:03:58.380 --> 00:04:02.540
Polar Bear's café is 
crowded again today.

00:04:02.540 --> 00:04:04.930
That's because the coffee 
and the food are excellent.

00:04:05.830 --> 00:04:07.740
It has a nice atmosphere, too.

00:04:07.740 --> 00:04:08.810
It sure is.

00:04:09.820 --> 00:04:12.690
There are lots of pretty girls, too.

00:04:12.690 --> 00:04:13.640
There sure are.

00:04:14.760 --> 00:04:17.590
Lots of exotic animals, too.

00:04:17.590 --> 00:04:18.610
True, true.

00:04:19.680 --> 00:04:23.550
Polar Bear is pretty cool for 
running a café, isn't he?

00:04:24.100 --> 00:04:25.070
You think so?

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:29.400
However, since you're always lazing 
around here as a customer,

00:04:29.400 --> 00:04:31.490
you're not as cool, Mr. Penguin.

00:04:31.490 --> 00:04:34.020
Could you stop comparing us?

00:04:34.020 --> 00:04:36.670
Oh, Polar Bear, one café mocha, please <i>(choudai)</i>.

00:04:39.220 --> 00:04:40.540
That would be a low dining 
table <i>(chabudai)</i>.

00:04:41.150 --> 00:04:43.630
Success

00:04:42.050 --> 00:04:43.650
That would be homework <i>(shukudai)</i>.

00:04:44.690 --> 00:04:46.090
Those would be brothers <i>(kyoudai)</i>.

00:04:46.960 --> 00:04:49.150
<i>Please</i>, okay?

00:04:49.870 --> 00:04:51.660
Here you go, one café mocha.

00:04:52.660 --> 00:04:54.760
Couldn't you just do 
that from the beginning?

00:04:54.760 --> 00:04:56.410
Please enjoy yourself.

00:04:58.290 --> 00:05:00.810
I'm going to step out 
for a bit, Miss Sasako.

00:05:00.810 --> 00:05:02.480
Oh, okay, Mr. Polar Bear.

00:05:03.080 --> 00:05:03.940
Take care!

00:05:05.860 --> 00:05:09.830
I know! What if I open up a café, too?

00:05:09.830 --> 00:05:10.950
Really? You?

00:05:11.530 --> 00:05:12.890
Panda's Café!

00:05:13.690 --> 00:05:14.910
Not very original.

00:05:15.770 --> 00:05:18.130
I wonder what kind of 
café it would be.

00:05:19.830 --> 00:05:23.590
I think it should be mellow, 
with a retro feel.

00:05:23.850 --> 00:05:26.430
Well, the concept isn't terrible.

00:05:29.570 --> 00:05:31.210
<i>Welcome!</i>

00:05:33.060 --> 00:05:35.270
I'm so cute!

00:05:35.760 --> 00:05:37.450
Please don't say that about yourself.

00:05:38.160 --> 00:05:39.230
And then,

00:05:40.290 --> 00:05:44.150
I think I'm going to decorate 
the interior with my collection.

00:05:44.770 --> 00:05:47.680
And your collection 
consists of panda items?

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:50.380
Yep. They're super cute!

00:05:51.620 --> 00:05:52.590
What?

00:05:52.590 --> 00:05:54.250
Panda everything.

00:05:54.250 --> 00:05:56.150
Is there a problem?

00:05:56.840 --> 00:05:59.580
No, not really. Go on.

00:06:00.390 --> 00:06:04.440
<i>Our specialty is the 
Daily Special Bamboo Lunch.</i>

00:06:04.440 --> 00:06:06.550
<i>Here's our menu.</i>

