00:06:22.290 --> 00:06:23.760
Wait a second.

00:06:23.760 --> 00:06:27.310
You're only serving things 
you like at your café.

00:06:28.220 --> 00:06:31.990
I'm sure that everyone will 
like the things I like.

00:06:32.390 --> 00:06:34.360
Bamboo is delicious.

00:06:34.360 --> 00:06:36.250
You're not going to carry any raw fish?

00:06:37.660 --> 00:06:40.500
They don't have raw fish at cafés.

00:06:41.220 --> 00:06:43.750
They don't have bamboo at cafés either.

00:06:45.470 --> 00:06:48.230
They do at Polar Bear's Café.

00:06:48.230 --> 00:06:50.220
You're the only one that 
orders it, though.

00:06:50.710 --> 00:06:53.940
I'd like it if you carried raw fish.

00:06:53.940 --> 00:06:57.310
Really? We do have boiled 
young bamboo though.

00:06:57.910 --> 00:07:00.190
That'd be a very different genre.

00:07:00.190 --> 00:07:01.130
Exactly!

00:07:01.130 --> 00:07:03.060
Not to mention your Bamboo Sets of

00:07:03.060 --> 00:07:05.190
Pine, Bamboo, and Plum 
are rather confusing.

00:07:06.040 --> 00:07:07.590
You think so?

00:07:07.590 --> 00:07:09.530
You're not going to get 
 many customers

00:07:09.530 --> 00:07:11.160
with a menu based solely on bamboo.

00:07:11.930 --> 00:07:14.670
What? There'll be tons!

00:07:14.670 --> 00:07:16.240
Exactly what makes you think that?

00:07:17.100 --> 00:07:20.210
You'll come to Panda's 
Café, right, Mr. Llama?

00:07:21.070 --> 00:07:24.170
I get a stomachache 
when I eat bamboo.

00:07:26.410 --> 00:07:28.680
What should I do, Mr. Penguin?

00:07:29.250 --> 00:07:31.130
Why don't you offer 
some normal food, too?

00:07:34.460 --> 00:07:36.560
See? Like pasta.

00:07:38.100 --> 00:07:40.230
Bamboo pasta! That's a great idea!

00:07:40.750 --> 00:07:42.520
Er, let's leave out the bamboo?

00:07:43.430 --> 00:07:46.730
I really want to open Panda's Café.

00:07:49.440 --> 00:07:50.900
In Preparation

00:07:51.640 --> 00:07:53.360
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:07:54.250 --> 00:07:55.320
Welcome!

00:08:02.490 --> 00:08:03.710
Change everything back.

00:08:04.620 --> 00:08:06.670
One order of bamboo coming right up!

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:09.270
We can make it a large 
serving if you'd like.

00:08:10.090 --> 00:08:11.630
What do you say?

00:08:13.380 --> 00:08:14.810
Change everything back.

00:08:17.030 --> 00:08:18.940
Your idea just doesn't work, Panda.

00:08:18.940 --> 00:08:20.570
I'll open a café.

00:08:21.780 --> 00:08:23.330
What kind of café will it be?

00:08:23.930 --> 00:08:25.140
Let's see...

00:08:27.010 --> 00:08:28.610
I'll call it Penguin's Café.

00:08:29.830 --> 00:08:31.490
Very original.

00:08:32.530 --> 00:08:35.180
It'll be a Japanese-style café.

00:08:36.770 --> 00:08:42.350
Let's see, the menu will center 
around alcohol and raw fish.

